{
  "title": "sekans_kuyu_hastalik",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node:start",
      "type": "START",
      "position": "(0.0, 0.0)"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:c1",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(350.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Miraen",
      "text": "Saruca Hatun... In the water drawn from the square well I detected the taint of sulfur and rust. Do not let the children drink without boiling it first."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:c2",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(700.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Saruca Hatun",
      "text": "Mercy, daughter Miraen! Let us not invite the scourge of pestilence in the dead of winter. Shall we slake quicklime into the well; what say you?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt1",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(1050.0, -90.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "Open the quicklime pit immediately and cast three measures into the shaft; let the well rest for two days."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt2",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(1050.0, 90.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "We cannot shutter the well, the folk will thirst; purify only the buckets under suspicion."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep1",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1400.0, -90.0)",
      "character": "Miraen",
      "text": "A righteous decision, master guard. Quicklime breaks the venom of the deep shaft; within two days the water will be clear as a polished mirror."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep2",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1400.0, 90.0)",
      "character": "Saruca Hatun",
      "text": "Then we shall boil every kettle over the tandoor embers before distributing water, child; we take no careless risks."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act1",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1750.0, -90.0)",
      "description": "Köy Morali",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
